{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31162","headline":"鄜州进白野鹊 · 薛能","name":"鄜州进白野鹊","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"轻毛叠雪翅开霜，红觜能深练尾长。\n名应玉符朝北阙，色柔金性瑞西方。\n不忧云路填河远，爲对天颜送喜忙。\n从此定知栖息处，月宫琼树是仙乡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}